  "topic": "navigation",
  "subtopic": "templates",
  "title": "Dependent expression members",
  "summary": "A member accessed on what a dependent subscript, call or `auto` variable evaluates to resolves to the member declared on the class template",
  "prose": "Where the call has a `const` overload, the constness of the object picks\nthe one it names; overloads that differ in their parameters are all\nlisted.",
  "status": "supported",
